    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hordes of Vampires &amp; Their Masters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on relentless bloodthirsty vampires and their powerful shadow masters in intense combat.\u00a0Battle cultists, androids, mercenaries, and other deadly foes along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/6a697bd564d86b33a9be759fdc0f5710.poster.avif?t=1751018238\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/6a697bd564d86b33a9be759fdc0f5710.webm?t=1751018238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/6a697bd564d86b33a9be759fdc0f5710.mp4?t=1751018238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Sci-Fi Arsenal &amp; Vampiric Powers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix and match two unique playstyles \u2013 sci-fi guns and vampiric abilities, both with deep upgrade trees. Customize your combat experience and dominate enemies your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/6145ca4b4c6bd1f5557459b0523b754f.poster.avif?t=1751018238\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/6145ca4b4c6bd1f5557459b0523b754f.webm?t=1751018238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/6145ca4b4c6bd1f5557459b0523b754f.mp4?t=1751018238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Immersive Story &amp;\u00a0Environments</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the boots of a SpecOps contractor stranded on a threatened distant colony. Uncover the mysteries of a sinister cult and decide the fate of an entire planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/dc4386885fc6c82fcbc08541e9c3c7a7.poster.avif?t=1751018238\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/dc4386885fc6c82fcbc08541e9c3c7a7.webm?t=1751018238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/dc4386885fc6c82fcbc08541e9c3c7a7.mp4?t=1751018238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Challenging Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against unforgettable antagonists who gradually turn against you as the story unfolds. Every battle is a test of skill, strategy, and survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Intense Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adrenaline-fueled cinematic moments keep the blood pumping. Face off against bloodthirsty vampires and their powerful masters in fast-paced, action-packed storyline.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Diverse Locations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore expansive, richly detailed environments with full freedom of movement\u00a0\u2013 venture through massive industrial complexes, Martian landscape quarries, towering skyscrapers, and eerie research facilities with occult influences. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Story That Shapes Your Fate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Ron Adams, a SpecOps contractor, you'll forge alliances, face deadly foes, and determine the fate of those around you. Every decision carves your destiny and shapes the future of the planet. Will you remain human or embrace the dark side?  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Standalone PC-quality VR Graphics</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in highly optimized, PC-quality visuals on a standalone VR device\u00a0\u2013 delivering a high-fidelity experience with no external hardware required.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hordes of Vampires &amp; Their Masters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on relentless bloodthirsty vampires and their powerful shadow masters in intense combat.\u00a0Battle cultists, androids, mercenaries, and other deadly foes along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/6a697bd564d86b33a9be759fdc0f5710.poster.avif?t=1751018238\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/6a697bd564d86b33a9be759fdc0f5710.webm?t=1751018238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/6a697bd564d86b33a9be759fdc0f5710.mp4?t=1751018238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Sci-Fi Arsenal &amp; Vampiric Powers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix and match two unique playstyles \u2013 sci-fi guns and vampiric abilities, both with deep upgrade trees. Customize your combat experience and dominate enemies your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/6145ca4b4c6bd1f5557459b0523b754f.poster.avif?t=1751018238\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/6145ca4b4c6bd1f5557459b0523b754f.webm?t=1751018238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/6145ca4b4c6bd1f5557459b0523b754f.mp4?t=1751018238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Immersive Story &amp;\u00a0Environments</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the boots of a SpecOps contractor stranded on a threatened distant colony. Uncover the mysteries of a sinister cult and decide the fate of an entire planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/dc4386885fc6c82fcbc08541e9c3c7a7.poster.avif?t=1751018238\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/dc4386885fc6c82fcbc08541e9c3c7a7.webm?t=1751018238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/dc4386885fc6c82fcbc08541e9c3c7a7.mp4?t=1751018238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Challenging Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against unforgettable antagonists who gradually turn against you as the story unfolds. Every battle is a test of skill, strategy, and survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Intense Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adrenaline-fueled cinematic moments keep the blood pumping. Face off against bloodthirsty vampires and their powerful masters in fast-paced, action-packed storyline.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Diverse Locations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore expansive, richly detailed environments with full freedom of movement\u00a0\u2013 venture through massive industrial complexes, Martian landscape quarries, towering skyscrapers, and eerie research facilities with occult influences. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Story That Shapes Your Fate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Ron Adams, a SpecOps contractor, you'll forge alliances, face deadly foes, and determine the fate of those around you. Every decision carves your destiny and shapes the future of the planet. Will you remain human or embrace the dark side?  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Standalone PC-quality VR Graphics</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in highly optimized, PC-quality visuals on a standalone VR device\u00a0\u2013 delivering a high-fidelity experience with no external hardware required.\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "Dixotomia is a VR shooter in a world of a sci-fi dystopia. Become a SpecOps contractor, fight vampire cult and its vile bosses. Experience immersive action with brutal guns and vampiric abilities. Can you uncover dark secrets of a distant planet and return back unchanged?",
